Subject: [PATCH] Preserve raw neutral recall predictions for map inference only

Retain exact singleton OTHER enum output before Samsung discards neutral labels.
Null leaves Samsung's original filter in control for unsafe, failed, empty,
mixed, query and normal action predictions. The wrapper still appends native
map-URL labels before deciding whether an exact neutral result needs fallback.
Restrict marked model results to Browse Location after Samsung extraction and
validation. No register count changes. Requires NativeMapGate client helper.

--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/SBertGatingModel.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/SBertGatingModel.smali
@@ -3667,6 +3667,16 @@
     :cond_c
     check-cast v0, Ljava/util/List;

+    invoke-static {v0}, Lio/mesalabs/rezoss/ai/NativeMapGate;->beforeFilter(Ljava/util/List;)Ljava/util/List;
+
+    move-result-object v1
+
+    if-eqz v1, :rezoss_original_label_filter
+
+    return-object v1
+
+    :rezoss_original_label_filter
+
     move-object v1, v0

     check-cast v1, Ljava/lang/Iterable;
--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/GatingModelFactory$GatingModelWrapper.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/GatingModelFactory$GatingModelWrapper.smali
@@ -590,5 +590,9 @@
 
     move-result-object p0
 
+    invoke-static {p1, p0}, Lio/mesalabs/rezoss/ai/NativeMapGate;->extend(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/util/List;)Ljava/util/List;
+
+    move-result-object p0
+
     return-object p0
 .end method
--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/RecallProvider.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/RecallProvider.smali
@@ -540,6 +540,10 @@
     move-result-object v2
 
     :goto_2
+    invoke-static {v8, v2}, Lio/mesalabs/rezoss/ai/NativeMapGate;->filter(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/util/List;)Ljava/util/List;
+
+    move-result-object v2
+
     if-eqz v6, :cond_a
 
     new-instance v3, Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/SavePlacesActionBuilder;
